// File:    std/orm.skink
// Purpose: Lightweight object-relational mapping over std/db. Structs
//          map to tables by convention (lowercase type name + "s"),
//          with [column(name=...)] and [db(...)] field tags for
//          renaming, primary keys, auto-increment, and ignoring fields.
//          Values move between rows and structs via std/reflect.
